<title>HONG KONG: Grand Orient returns to black in 1st half.</title>
<headline>Grand Orient returns to black in 1st half.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.1 gain    vs 5.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    2.57 profit vs 8.13 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     190.02	vs 42.24</p>
<p>    Company name		 Grand Orient Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
